WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.870
SCP-682 Vs SCP-2578-D.

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:09.570
The Hard to Destroy Reptile would kill millions
if ever it was allowed to escape and be free.

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:16.350
Would the SCP-2578-D Impaler spacecraft be
able to put its reign of terror to an end?

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:22.249
SCP-2578-D is a mysterious spacecraft with
an immensely powerful and precise proton cannon.

00:00:22.249 --> 00:00:27.260
It seeks to protect democracy and human rights
from tyrants, fascists, and authoritarians

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:30.859
through controlled assassinations, or “Impaler
Events.”

00:00:30.859 --> 00:00:35.680
One such event befell 682 in containment,
with five cranial penetrative wounds that

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:40.520
pierced its skull during a brief period, leaving
it out of commission for 32 minutes.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:44.740
It then woke back up and yelled “F YOU AND
ALL THREE OF YOUR MOONS!”

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:45.980
up to the ceiling.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:50.110
The spacecraft later sent an email to the
Foundation, apologizing that it hadn’t killed

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:51.320
682.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:54.760
In its defense, though, it hadn’t missed
a single shot.

